    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i'm running a race where the finish line keeps moving further away. every single thing i earn just goes straight back out to pay for the space i'm taking up. rent, utilities, debt... it's like i'm just a middleman for my own survival. i work 40+ hours just to stay at zero. it doesn't even feel like living anymore, just existing to pay bills until i can't.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
